{"5028850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arena of the Forge", "steam_appid": 5028850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5034100], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter</strong> the Arena. <strong>Slay</strong> your Enemies. <strong>Forge</strong> Their Gear. Become stronger with every wave, or die in the attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/extras/90d9266079bc33b4bf7ac880a3309e9e.poster.avif?t=1787932711\" width=490 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/extras/90d9266079bc33b4bf7ac880a3309e9e.webm?t=1787932711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/extras/90d9266079bc33b4bf7ac880a3309e9e.mp4?t=1787932711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While in the Arena you will face <i><strong>40+</strong></i> different enemies and bosses in increasingly difficult waves of enemies. Collect and forge gear in order to survive the ever increasing challenge of the Arena. Utilize <i><strong>50+</strong></i> swords, spells, bows, potions and more to overcome the enemies you will face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/extras/affec661072a15c84e6c7fa03cfe83e2.poster.avif?t=1787932711\" width=618 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/extras/affec661072a15c84e6c7fa03cfe83e2.webm?t=1787932711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/extras/affec661072a15c84e6c7fa03cfe83e2.mp4?t=1787932711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Loot</strong></i>, <i><strong>Forge</strong></i> (Upgrade), <i><strong>Buy</strong></i>, and <i><strong>Sell</strong></i> your gear to maximize your monster slaying potential within the Arena</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/extras/4a4c162a02e39ab58c1592e6755d4d8b.poster.avif?t=1787932711\" width=490 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/extras/4a4c162a02e39ab58c1592e6755d4d8b.webm?t=1787932711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/extras/4a4c162a02e39ab58c1592e6755d4d8b.mp4?t=1787932711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through waves upon waves of enemies to complete the bestiary and armory collections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through the arena your way, with gameplay modifiers and difficulty settings to fine-tune the gameplay experience for yourself. Or even accomplish the game's greatest achievement of <i><strong>DAMO</strong></i> (Demon all Modifiers on).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/extras/f3746b21db7509635dccedcb462bf554.poster.avif?t=1787932711\" width=618 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/extras/f3746b21db7509635dccedcb462bf554.webm?t=1787932711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/extras/f3746b21db7509635dccedcb462bf554.mp4?t=1787932711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a change of pace or even greater challenge enter the <i><strong>Onslaught</strong></i>, Arena of the Forge's boss rush mode where you will face endless waves of bosses with no standard waves to act as a reprieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter</strong> the Arena. <strong>Slay</strong> your Enemies. <strong>Forge</strong> Their Gear. Become stronger with every wave, or die in the attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/extras/90d9266079bc33b4bf7ac880a3309e9e.poster.avif?t=1787932711\" width=490 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/extras/90d9266079bc33b4bf7ac880a3309e9e.webm?t=1787932711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/extras/90d9266079bc33b4bf7ac880a3309e9e.mp4?t=1787932711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While in the Arena you will face <i><strong>40+</strong></i> different enemies and bosses in increasingly difficult waves of enemies. Collect and forge gear in order to survive the ever increasing challenge of the Arena. Utilize <i><strong>50+</strong></i> swords, spells, bows, potions and more to overcome the enemies you will face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline