\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/extras/f3746b21db7509635dccedcb462bf554.poster.avif?t=1787932711\" width=618 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/extras/f3746b21db7509635dccedcb462bf554.webm?t=1787932711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/extras/f3746b21db7509635dccedcb462bf554.mp4?t=1787932711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a change of pace or even greater challenge enter the <i><strong>Onslaught</strong></i>, Arena of the Forge's boss rush mode where you will face endless waves of bosses with no standard waves to act as a reprieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "short_description": "Fight. Loot. Forge. Repeat. Arena of the Forge is a pixel art endless arena battler. Fight through waves of enemies and bosses to collect and forge stronger gear in the Arena or enter the Onslaught for a boss rush experience.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/a9fa7b69c460850dc7787f4aa4863cabbe2f0afe/header.jpg?t=1787932711", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/6179e4fed6d9f47ee783fc0503f9581e3c5d5800/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787932711", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5028850/6179e4fed6d9f47ee783fc0503f9581e3c5d5800/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787932711", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<